exec-jupiter test vectors (PMJ W5, read 2026-10-29): public Solana mainnet
transactions of Jupiter Predict (program 3ZZuTbwC6aJbvteyVxXUS7gtFYdf7AuXeitx6VyvjvUp),
each the base64 of the landed wire transaction exactly as
`getTransaction(sig, {"encoding":"base64","maxSupportedTransactionVersion":0})`
on api.mainnet-beta.solana.com returned it. Public chain data used as known
answers for `tx::guard_order` / `tx::guard_claim` (the SDK-vector precedent);
other people's transactions, never ours, no key of ours in them.

